<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!-- Hardened runtime with no exceptions, and deliberately no sandbox: the
     igniter writes its captures both to ~/Library/Application Support/CodeSaver
     and into the saver extension's own container, reads the Dock's hot-corner
     preferences, and lists every process to spot a running saver. Screen
     Recording is a TCC grant, not an entitlement. -->
